{"title":"Ogre Bone Needle","html":"<article class=\"wp\"><div class=\"wp-main\">\n      <p class=\"wp-lede\">Monster drop: Mountain Ogre, Ogre Shaman, Ogre Mauler, Ogre Butcher, Ogre Charger +1 more</p>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <h2>What it’s for</h2><p>Every gem transmuter has a <b>Reagent</b> tab, the Dark Witch included. This reagent and <b>500 gold</b> get you a gem of a random kind of <b>1c, 1.5c or 2c</b>. Monsters no longer drop reagents.</p><p class=\"muted\">See <a href=\"#/guide/reagents\">Reagents</a>.</p>\n      <h2>How to get it</h2>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <div style=\"margin-top:10px\"><b>Recorded monster drops</b><div class=\"chip-row\"><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-shaman\" title=\"Ogre Shaman - dropped it in 2 of 594 looted corpses (1/297)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/f9a97fb7ded29e1c31d3.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Shaman</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/297<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mountain\" title=\"Mountain Ogre - dropped it in 2 of 859 looted corpses (1/430)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/fe10b0281fa1b1c70ebf.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Mountain Ogre</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/430<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-mauler\" title=\"Ogre Mauler - dropped it in 2 of 896 looted corpses (1/448)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/75903b759d1521edd876.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Mauler</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/448<br>×1</span></div><div class=\"entity-chip monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-charger\" title=\"Ogre Charger - dropped it in 4 of 2,466 looted corpses (1/617)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/253503604ab2f59ece68.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Charger</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/617<br>×1</span></div><button type=\"button\" class=\"chip-row-more-btn\" data-label=\"+2 more\">+2 more</button><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink elite\" data-monster=\"ogre-butcher\" title=\"Ogre Butcher - dropped it in 2 of 1,570 looted corpses (1/785)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/2cf1b40edc5c1e611ef5.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Butcher</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/785<br>×1</span></div><div hidden class=\"entity-chip chip-row-extra monsterlink\" data-monster=\"ogre-elder\" title=\"Ogre Elder - dropped it in 1 of 1,375 looted corpses (1/1,375)\"><img class=\"thumb monsterthumb\" src=\"data/img/6b8e9887508499fc36f7.webp\" alt=\"\"><span class=\"entity-chip-label\">Ogre Elder</span><span class=\"entity-chip-stat\">1/1,375<br>×1</span></div></div><div class=\"s muted\" style=\"margin-top:6px\">Drop rate as 1/X (about 1 kill in X drops it, counted over the corpses of each monster whose loot was recorded), and ×N, how many come in one drop.</div></div>\n      <button type=\"button\" class=\"show-on-map\" data-map-kind=\"item\" data-map-id=\"ogre-bone-needle\">Show where to get it on the map</button>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      \n    </div><aside class=\"wp-infobox\"><div class=\"wp-pic \"><img src=\"data/img/b650deb68f23ed25cd11.svg\" alt=\"Ogre Bone Needle\"></div><h3>Ogre Bone Needle</h3><table>\n      \n      \n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Dropped by</th><td>6 monsters</td></tr>\n      \n      \n      <tr><th>Last seen</th><td>11/2/2026, 2:23:27 PM</td></tr>\n    </table></aside></article>"}